    "result_text": "The build is green. There are only 3 test files (`AcceptanceBase`, `AuditLogCapture`, and the one test class `AcceptanceTest`), and the full suite passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the welcome notification on successful owner create in `OwnerRestControllerV1.java`:\n\n1. Added a dedicated logger named `NOTIFY`:\n   ```java\n   private static final Logger NOTIFY = LoggerFactory.getLogger(\"NOTIFY\");\n   ```\n\n2. Emitted the welcome line after the owner is saved and the existing `AUDIT` events fire (so it only runs on a successful create), including both the owner id and the memberId:\n   ```java\n   NOTIFY.info(\"welcome owner id={} memberId={}\", owner.getId(), owner.getMemberId());\n   ```\n\nThe `AcceptanceTest.coreEnqueuesWelcome` test \u2014 which captures the `NOTIFY` logger and asserts a line contains both the owner id and its memberId \u2014 passes, and `./mvnw test` reports `BUILD SUCCESS`.",
